# uClibc-ng regex tests
# Licensed under the LGPL v2.1, see the file COPYING.LIB in this tarball.

# testregex is AT&T's conformance survey, not a pass/fail test: leftassoc
# and rightassoc ask for opposite interpretations, and glibc 2.43 differs in
# the same 54 cases.  It exits with the number of differences, and its output
# must match testregex.out.good, so a new difference or a regexec that does
# not terminate shows up.
RET_testregex := 31
